---
// ArchitectureSection.astro — Fundamentos de Ingeniería y Anteproyecto
---

<section class="py-16 border-t border-[var(--border-subtle)]" id="aboutSection">
  <div class="app-container">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-12">
      <span class="inline-block px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-[var(--bg-sunken)] border border-[var(--border-subtle)] text-xs font-mono font-bold text-[var(--primary)] mb-4 shadow-[var(--neu-pressed-sm)]">
        DUOC UC SAN JOAQUÍN · APT122 CAPSTONE 18 SEMANAS
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-[var(--text-main)] mb-3">
        Fundamentos de Ingeniería de PlayMatch
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-[var(--text-body)] leading-relaxed">
        Desarrollo orientado a transformar la convivencia social en los videojuegos y la organización de torneos competitivos mediante arquitectura distribuida, buenas prácticas de datos y optimización de latencia.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      
      {/* Pilar 1 */}
      <div class="bg-[var(--bg-card)] shadow-[var(--neu-flat)] border border-[var(--border-subtle)] rounded-3xl p-6 flex flex-col gap-3">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[var(--bg-card)] shadow-[var(--neu-flat-sm)] border border-[var(--border-subtle)] flex items-center justify-center text-[var(--accent-mint)]">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-[var(--text-main)]">Sistema de Convivencia</h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-[var(--text-body)] leading-relaxed">
          Métrica de Karma ponderada que incentiva y premia la deportividad, aislando conductas tóxicas de las salas comunitarias.
        </p>
      </div>

      {/* Pilar 2 */}
      <div class="bg-[var(--bg-card)] shadow-[var(--neu-flat)] border border-[var(--border-subtle)] rounded-3xl p-6 flex flex-col gap-3">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[var(--bg-card)] shadow-[var(--neu-flat-sm)] border border-[var(--border-subtle)] flex items-center justify-center text-[var(--primary)]">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"></polygon>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-[var(--text-main)]">Scoring Multidimensional</h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-[var(--text-body)] leading-relaxed">
          Algoritmo heurístico que contrasta franjas horarias semanales, roles tácticos, cercanía de elo y compatibilidad declarada.
        </p>
      </div>

      {/* Pilar 3 */}
      <div class="bg-[var(--bg-card)] shadow-[var(--neu-flat)] border border-[var(--border-subtle)] rounded-3xl p-6 flex flex-col gap-3">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[var(--bg-card)] shadow-[var(--neu-flat-sm)] border border-[var(--border-subtle)] flex items-center justify-center text-[var(--accent-amber)]">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <polyline points="8 21 12 17 16 21"></polyline>
            <line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12" y2="21"></line>
            <path d="M7 4H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v2a5 5 0 0 0 5 5h1"></path>
            <path d="M17 4h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2a5 5 0 0 1-5 5h-1"></path>
            <rect x="7" y="2" width="10" height="11" rx="2"></rect>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-[var(--text-main)]">Gestión Centralizada</h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-[var(--text-body)] leading-relaxed">
          Generación automática de llaves de enfrentamiento y registro de alineaciones, erradicando planillas manuales y chats dispersos.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
